<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine posts $607 mln trade deficit in February.</title>
<headline>Ukraine posts $607 mln trade deficit in February.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine posted a trade deficit of $607.2 million in February, the Statistics Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>UKRAINE MERCHANDISE TRADE	    Jan-Feb 97  Jan 97  Jan-Feb 96</p>
<p>    Exports ($million)		 1,879.9	 960.9 1,534.9</p>
<p>    Imports ($million)		 2,487.1     1,329.8 1,637.7</p>
<p>    Balance ($million)		  -607.2	-368.9  -102.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are for trade with all countries. Trade with former Soviet republics resulted in a deficit of $936.2 million in February.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244 9150</p>
</text>
